{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04190","headline":"同辛簿简仰酬思玄上人林泉四首 二 · 骆宾王","name":"同辛簿简仰酬思玄上人林泉四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳晨临上月，幽赏狎中园。\n有蝶堪成梦，无羊可触藩。\n忘怀南涧藻，蠲思北堂萱。\n坐叹华滋歇，思君谁爲言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04190.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04190","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}